      {
        "test": "shortcut",
        "text": "Untrimmed vs trimmed on the same clips: -0.1468 EER (CI [-0.1544, -0.1378]) -- the silence shortcut is present."
      },
      {
        "test": "duration",
        "text": "Silence replaced by digital zeros *at its original length* still beats trimmed by 0.1238 EER, so silence duration/position alone reaches the model. It still trails untrimmed by 0.0230 EER (CI excludes zero), so the silence's content adds information on top of its length. Does NOT show: which property of the content matters."
      },
      {
        "test": "zeros_fixed",
        "text": "zeros_fixed: -0.0185 EER vs trimmed (CI [-0.0265, -0.0080]) -- significantly different from trimmed, so the replacement itself carries or disrupts signal. Does NOT separate duration from content on its own."
      },
      {
        "test": "noise_fixed",
        "text": "noise_fixed: -0.0117 EER vs trimmed (CI [-0.0203, -0.0007]) -- significantly different from trimmed, so the replacement itself carries or disrupts signal. Does NOT separate duration from content on its own."
      },
      {
        "test": "content",
        "text": "A classifier given only 0.2s of each clip's genuine silence (fixed length, so no duration information) reaches EER 0.0440 [0.0395, 0.0484] on 2161 bf / 6183 sp -- the silence *content* carries label information beyond duration. Does NOT show: which acoustic property (noise floor, spectral shape, codec) it is, and it only covers clips with at least that much silence."
      }
    ]
